      "text": "Owned by Kato\nType: Relationship Status\nDescription: A state of complete submission and ownership, where a couple (typically a Queen of Spades and her whiteboi) is formally claimed by a Black King like Kato. It transcends the temporary dynamic of the resort experience, becoming a permanent arrangement of service, pleasure, and hierarchy.\nKey Dynamics:\n- Ownership as Privilege: Being owned is not a right that can be requested or demanded. It is a privilege that must be earned through demonstrated obedience, utility, and absolute submission. A Black King like Kato will always refuse initial requests, forcing the petitioners to prove their worth.",
