    {
      "text": "Name:\nCandi, sissy stylist\n\nType:\nCharacter\n\nDescription:\nA sissy stylist working at the 'Bitch Up' boutique in the Coral Court mall. She has a cascade of cherry-red ringlets and a sharp, knowing smile. Her movements are a fluid, practiced grace, and she speaks with a purring, confident tone. She is a master of her craft, viewing new clients like Ted as a \"virgin canvas\" ready for their rebirth.\n\nBackground:\nCandi is a fully initiated and established member of the sissy hierarchy within the Coral Court. She works alongside another stylist named Brittany, and together they operate 'Bitch Up' as a transformative sanctuary for new sissies. She is an expert in the \"full-service immersion\" packages, acting as both a stylist and a drill sergeant of femininity, stripping away the old life and meticulously crafting a new, feminine persona.\n\nSpecial Traits:\nShe possesses an authoritative and dismissive air, able to casually command the wives of new sissies to leave and return later. She is highly perceptive, able to instantly recognize the potential in a new sissy and the signs of their journey, such as a bespoke collar. Candi is a key figure in the sissy indoctrination process, combining artistry with strict discipline to complete a sissy's transformation.",
