    {
      "text": "Name: Keyholder Authority  \nType: Role/Title  \nDescription: The Keyholder is the woman (or designated Black man) who possesses the chastity key of a whiteboi, granting them absolute control over his sexual release, physical presentation, and daily behavior. Their authority is both symbolic and practical, often reinforced through psychological dominance and strict enforcement of rules.  \nBackground: Rooted in power dynamics and fetish culture, the Keyholder role emerged as a central figure in chastity and BDSM relationships, particularly within racialized power exchange scenarios. The Keyholder’s role is often sanctified by mutual agreement, though their power may be perceived as inherent or divinely ordained by those under their control.  \nSpecial Traits:  \n- **Unquestioned Authority**: The Keyholder’s decisions regarding release, punishment, or reward are final.  \n- **Psychological Control**: They may employ teasing, denial, or humiliation to maintain dominance.  \n- **Aesthetic Oversight**: The Keyholder dictates the whiteboi’s appearance, from clothing to grooming.  \n- **Racial Dynamics**: In some contexts, the designation of a Black man as Keyholder amplifies the racialized power imbalance.",
